<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>An example of data distribution, where <math id="S3.T1.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{M}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}</annotation></semantics></math> refers to LLaMA-3-8B.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
<section id="S3.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">3.2 </span>Models</h3>

<div id="S3.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Given the dominance of decoder-only architectures in current LLMs, our analysis focuses exclusively on models of this type. We examine five LLMs from two model families: <span id="S3.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">LLaMA-2-7B</span>, <span id="S3.SS2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">LLaMA-2-13B</span>, and <span id="S3.SS2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">LLaMA-2-70B</span> from the LLaMA-2 family <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib32" title="" class="ltx_ref">Touvron et al. (2023)</a></cite>, and <span id="S3.SS2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">LLaMA-3-8B</span> and <span id="S3.SS2.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">LLaMA-3-70B</span> from the LLaMA-3 family <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib8" title="" class="ltx_ref">Dubey et al. (2024)</a></cite>.<span id="footnote3" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">3</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">3</sup>
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">3</span>
              
              
              
            Details of models can be found in Appendix <a href="#A2.SS1" title="B.1 Details of Models ‣ Appendix B More Details of Experiments ‣ Analyzing the Effects of Supervised Fine-Tuning on Model Knowledgefrom Token and Parameter Levels" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.1</span></a>.</span></span></span></p>
</div>
<figure id="S3.F2" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="S3.F2.sf1" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.16596v1/id_LLaMA-3-8B.svg" id="S3.F2.sf1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/311;" width="476" height="311"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(a) </span>LLaMA-3-8B (In-Domain)</figcaption>
