<div id="S5.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We evaluate the performance of LLaMA-3-8B after restoring different proportions of parameters across various fine-tuning datasets. The results are summarized in Table <a href="#S5.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ 5.2 Results Analysis ‣ 5 Parameter-Level Analysis ‣ Analyzing the Effects of Supervised Fine-Tuning on Model Knowledgefrom Token and Parameter Levels" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>.
Our analysis of these results reveals several noteworthy findings.</p>
</div>
