<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Data Distribution of Different LLMs</h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Since data division is based on the model’s mastery of the data, we analyze the data distributions corresponding to different pre-trained LLMs. The results for LLaMA-3-8B are presented in Section <a href="#S3.SS1" title="3.1 Dataset ‣ 3 Experiments ‣ Analyzing the Effects of Supervised Fine-Tuning on Model Knowledgefrom Token and Parameter Levels" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.1</span></a>, while the distributions for other models are shown in Table <a href="#A4.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ Appendix D Data Distribution of Different LLMs ‣ Analyzing the Effects of Supervised Fine-Tuning on Model Knowledgefrom Token and Parameter Levels" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A4.T8" class="ltx_table">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure ltx_flex_table">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
